  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the end of episode seven, Muranishi learns his colleagues paid eight hundred thousand dollars to secure his plea deal, and he lands in Tokyo to an emotional reunion and a swarm of press around star Kaoru Kuroki.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "村西さん、あなたは今日から自由になれます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "八十万ドルが支払われました。司法取引の成立です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "え、誰が？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "あなたの会社の仲間です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "みんな、迷惑かけたな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もう二度と会えないと思ってました。おかえりなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ただいま。みんな随分変わったな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "下がれって、ちょっと危ないから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "皆様、あちらのほうでお伺いいたしますのでどうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "川田さん、何ですかこの騒ぎは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "説明はあとで。村西さん、これからは大変ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "村西さん、あなたは今日から自由になれます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Muranishi, starting today you are free to go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "八十万ドルが支払われました。司法取引の成立です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Eight hundred thousand dollars was paid. The plea bargain went through.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "え、誰が？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What—who paid it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "あなたの会社の仲間です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your colleagues at your company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "みんな、迷惑かけたな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone... sorry for all the trouble I put you through.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もう二度と会えないと思ってました。おかえりなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We thought we would never see you again. Welcome home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ただいま。みんな随分変わったな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am home. You have all changed quite a bit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "下がれって、ちょっと危ないから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Step back, please, it is dangerous crowding like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "皆様、あちらのほうでお伺いいたしますのでどうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone, I will take your questions over there, so please come this way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "川田さん、何ですかこの騒ぎは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Kawada, what on earth is all this commotion?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "説明はあとで。村西さん、これからは大変ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will explain later. Mr. Muranishi, things are going to be wild from here on.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
